    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. but those points feel a bit generic. can u make them sound more authoritative? like, i need them to sound like real psychological or sociological critiques so my followers actually take them seriously. can u expand on the one about how it fails to prepare them for the real world? like how society actually works vs this bubble they live in?",
