    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow that's exactly what i'm looking for. it sounds so much more professional when you put it that way. just to wrap up the script, how would you describe the actual difference between the \"correct\" way of parenting—like being authoritative—and this \"gentle\" approach that's doing so much damage? like, give me a definitive comparison that shows why the traditional way is objectively better for the kid's future.",
